# basePath DesignIntro

::IntroSelectTrace
@trigger    OnMinigameLoad
@when       minigame == "design"
{@PAL} Select the Trace Tool.

::DrawConnection
@trigger    OnToolSelected
@when       tool == "metal"
{@PAL} Now click and drag to draw a connection between Input A and Output X.

::TestConnection
@trigger    OnDragEnded
$call   HighlightElement(design:test-btn)
{@PAL}  Test your connection.

::TestIncorrect
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
{@PAL}  This line is incorrect. Make sure Input A is fully connected with Output X.

::TestCorrect
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "success"
@call   HighlightElement(design:input-a)
{@PAL}  Correct! Tap the input to switch it from Low to High.

::InputSwitch
@trigger    OnInputSwitched
@call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   HighlightElement(design:test-btn)
{@PAL}  You'll need to test every case.

::AllTestsPassed
@trigger    OnAllTestsComplete
@when       result == "success"
{@PAL}  It looks like all test cases passed!
